    maneno_sajili("During a state of emergency this right may be suspended to the extent strictly required by the emergency.", "Wakati wa hali ya hatari haki hii inaweza kusimamishwa kwa kiwango kinachohitajika kabisa na hali hiyo.", "Pendant l'état d'urgence, ce droit peut être suspendu dans la stricte mesure exigée par la situation.");
    maneno_sajili("Duties of the State", "Wajibu wa Dola", "Devoirs de l'État");
    maneno_sajili("Each region maintains its own police; a national police deals with offences against the state and crimes crossing regional boundaries.", "Kila mkoa una polisi wake; polisi wa taifa hushughulikia makosa dhidi ya dola na uhalifu unaovuka mipaka ya mikoa.", "Chaque région entretient sa propre police ; une police nationale traite des infractions contre l'État et des crimes franchissant les limites régionales.");
